Phase 4: Movie Detail Collection Detection & Bug Fixes

Added on-demand TMDB collection detection from the movie detail page,
so existing library movies can be linked to collections without re-adding.

New: CollectionService.detectMovieCollection(tmdbMovieId)
  — calls GET /movie/{id} on TMDB and extracts belongs_to_collection.

New: GET /api/movies/:id/tmdb-collection
  — returns { collection: { tmdbCollectionId, name, posterUrl } | null }.

New: MovieCollectionSection.tsx (7 tests)
  — auto-detects collection on mount; shows Monitor toggle + Add to Library;
    calls collectionApi.create() then collectionApi.sync() to link all movies.

Fix: posterPath → posterUrl in CollectionService.createCollection and syncCollectionMovies
  — Movie schema uses posterUrl (full URL); was crashing with PrismaClientValidationError.

Fix: POST /api/collections made idempotent
  — returns 200 + existing collection instead of 409 ConflictError,
    enabling retry after a partial sync failure.

Tests: collectionRoutes.create.test.ts (5 tests), movieApi.test.ts +2 tests.
